      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Right now, as far as the Liberation Army is \r\nconcerned, I believe the perfect—\r\nand final—opportunity to retake the fortress\r\nhas arrived.",
        "Jp" : "今、解放軍としては\r\n砦奪還への絶好の――\r\nそして最後の機運が巡ってきている、と\r\n俺は思っている"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 585855,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "So then, to bolster our forces, I sought to\r\nprocure supplies — but the soldiers I tasked with\r\nit have most likely gone missing.",
        "Jp" : "そこでだ、戦力を拡充するために\r\n物資を調達しようとしたんだが――\r\n物資調達を頼んだ戦士たちが\r\n行方不明になった可能性が高い"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 606643,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "E'en those I sent in pursuit have yet to return.\r\n'Tis evident aught has come to pass.",
        "Jp" : "後を追わせた者すら、なかなか戻らん\r\n何事かが起こっていることは明白だ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 659106,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
